OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CMan charged in connection with rape of 
OL,5,Cwoman in Glasgow park                  
OL,6,GA man has been charged over the rape   
OL,7,Gof a 22-year-old woman in a popular    
OL,8,GGlasgow park last Friday.              
OL,10,FThe 37-year-old was arrested and       
OL,11,Fcharged in connection with the serious 
OL,12,Fsexual assault of the woman at about   
OL,13,F23:50 on Friday, near to the bridge    
OL,14,Ffrom Kelvin Walkway.                   
OL,16,FThe woman had been walking through the 
OL,17,Fpark when the incident took place and  
OL,18,Fan appeal was later released by police.
OL,20,FThe man is due to appear at Glasgow    
OL,21,FSheriff Court on Wednesday.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
