OL,4,CVirtual reality gives new view of      
OL,5,CScotland's largest PoW camp            
OL,6,GScotland's largest prisoner of war     
OL,7,Gcamp has been brought back to life     
OL,8,Gwith the launch of a new virtual       
OL,9,Greality (VR) experience.               
OL,11,FStobs Camp outside Hawick was home to  
OL,12,Fabout 5,000 German prisoners and       
OL,13,Finternees during World War One.        
OL,15,FNow many of the 80 barrack huts,       
OL,16,Fexercise yards and cookhouses have     
OL,17,Fbeen recreated for a seven-minute-long 
OL,18,Fvirtual walk-through.                  
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
