OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CShoplifting and domestic abuse drive   
OL,5,Cup recorded crime                      
OL,6,GThe number of crimes recorded by       
OL,7,GPolice Scotland increased by 9% in the 
OL,8,Glast year, with significant spikes in  
OL,9,Gshoplifting and domestic abuse.        
OL,11,FStatistics for the 12 months leading   
OL,12,Fup to September revealed the force     
OL,13,Flogged 333,115 crimes - 16% more than  
OL,14,Fin 2022.                               
OL,16,FA breakdown showed shoplifting soared  
OL,17,Fby 26% (61,107 crimes) while domestic  
OL,18,Fabuse increased by 21% (3,415 crimes). 
OL,20,FNon-sexual crimes of violence went up  
OL,21,Fby 8%, sexual crimes by 5% and crimes  
OL,22,Fof dishonesty by 16%.             G3/4 
