OL,4,CProperty firm told to repay customers  
OL,5,Cthousands over 'unfair' sales tactics  
OL,6,GA property sales company has to pay    
OL,7,Gback more than #277,000 to customers   
OL,8,Gacross the UK after a watchdog found   
OL,9,Git had treated buyers unfairly by      
OL,10,Gmisrepresenting rental incomes.        
OL,12,FLet Property is facing "unprecedented" 
OL,13,Flevels of repayments after the UK      
OL,14,FProperty Ombudsman received nearly 200 
OL,15,Fcomplaints.                            
OL,17,FCustomers paid the company upfront     
OL,18,Ffees of about #3,000 each to reserve   
OL,19,Fbuy-to-let properties - but deals      
OL,20,Flater fell through after valuations    
OL,21,Fand rental income projections were     
OL,22,Ffound to be misleading.           G4/4 
